 This statement is closely related to <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Proposition 4.9.4. Exposé IV</span>, <a href="/bibliography/SGA4">SGA4</a>]</span>. In order to get the whole result, one should also use <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Remarque 4.7.4, Exposé IV</span>, <a href="/bibliography/SGA4">SGA4</a>]</span>. 